{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木中でメンバーの暴露しましたね（笑）\nメンバーのことは沢山しってるのです、観察してるのです。私はあざとい子もいっぱい食べる子も好物ですよっと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/12/19/5595548/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12/15に発売されました\nEX大衆さんで\n飛鳥×純奈×ひなで「ななみんを語ろう！」というのをやってます。語ってます。絵の奈々未と 撮影しました。主に飛鳥画伯やばい、逆にアート感あってオシャレカフェの壁画みたいになったの凄い。(私は髪型かいた)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/12/19/5595548/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"奈々未にすぐ画像送りつけたら、\n「人間の骨格じゃない」という回答を得ました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごいシュールなのでぜひ読んでね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/12/19/5595548/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"EX大衆さんのるのもお久しぶりで嬉しかった！とてもお話した気がする❥次はグラビアやりたい～～な～～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/12/19/5595548/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/12/19/5595548/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/12/19/5595548/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国握手会"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/12/19/5595548/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かりん×あみレーンに加わりました。\n(残念ながらあやね欠席で"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/12/19/5595548/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーちゃんのファンきたら、あやねの引っかからなかった「静岡っていってゲーム」か「クリームパン」やろう思ってた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/12/19/5595548/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつかまたペアになれますように！)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レーン来てくださったかたありがとう！\nかりんのファンもあみのファンも\n優しい方ばかりで楽しかったです！！！\nまた良ければ会いましょうね...❤︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、\nインフルエンザや風邪等の\n病気が流行っているみたいなので\n十分に予防してください！ね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの人が集まる場なので\n帰宅後の手洗いうがいの徹底！\nでお願いします(｡•  •｡)/病気辛いからね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/12/19/5595548/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーも体調不良だったり\n欠席者が多かったので心配....\n体調悪い方は無理せず！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"\"インフルになったけど無理してでも行きたい！！\"っていう人の気持ちわかるけど、自分の体のためにそういう時は休んでね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/12/19/5595548/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして大事な推しが感染し1週間以上仕事等々休む感じになるのはとても嫌だし推しが苦しむのも辛いのでね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/12/19/5595548/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/12/19/5595548/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/12/19/5595548/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お互い頑張って\n元気に2016年を終えようね！！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/12/19/5595548/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/12/19/5595548/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/12/19/5595548/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/12/19/5595548/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマス仕様の服でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/12/19/5595548/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか借りれたのできました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プレゼントくださいが多かったな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/12/19/5595548/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかいろいろやったけど、\n私なんかの1発芸のようなもので喜んでいただいたりしてありがたいよ幸せよ！\nまた来年ね。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/12/19/5595548/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ"}],"source":"archive"}